{"about_the_game":"L8R SK8R is a 3D platformer inspired by the classics of the fifth generation but with a unique twist that will make you feel like a speedrunner.<br><br>Just like those classics, new areas in the hub world are unlocked with a collection mechanic, but instead of collecting stars, crystals, or dragons, you have to collect time.<br><br>When exploring the hub world, you\u2019ll encounter time locks that hinder your progress.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/UnlockWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br>These locks will require you to collect a certain amount of time in order to be opened.<br><br>Every time you beat a level, you\u2019ll collect any time you shave off your previous best record. (Each level has a default record that it starts with. Basically a par time.)<br><br>So, for example, if you need another minute to open a lock, you could go back and beat the best times in three levels by 20 seconds. Or alternatively you could shave 10 seconds off of six levels. You might even find a shortcut that lets you take a whole minute off of just one level. The choice is yours!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master the core movement mechanics; wall jumping, wall riding, air dashing, sliding, boosting, and of course, double jumping.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/WallRidingWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Play through 25 unique levels set across various time periods across all of history, including five boss fights.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/Boss.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Defeat robotic minions, and when you do you\u2019ll earn a boost powerup that you can use later.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/Enemies.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Explore the levels to find better routes, hidden shortcuts, and collectables.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/CDCollectionWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Ever wanted to speedrun a game but felt too intimidated to start? L8R SK8R is a game that is built around making you approach it like a speedrunner, so it might just scratch that itch!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/JumpingAroundWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3046610?t=1744350282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744350282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/5b17b945e07899bc73f33076a736df5cd291c542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744350282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/5b17b945e07899bc73f33076a736df5cd291c542/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744350282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"L8R SK8R is a 3D platformer inspired by the classics of the fifth generation but with a unique twist that will make you feel like a speedrunner.<br><br>Just like those classics, new areas in the hub world are unlocked with a collection mechanic, but instead of collecting stars, crystals, or dragons, you have to collect time.<br><br>When exploring the hub world, you\u2019ll encounter time locks that hinder your progress.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/UnlockWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br>These locks will require you to collect a certain amount of time in order to be opened.<br><br>Every time you beat a level, you\u2019ll collect any time you shave off your previous best record. (Each level has a default record that it starts with. Basically a par time.)<br><br>So, for example, if you need another minute to open a lock, you could go back and beat the best times in three levels by 20 seconds. Or alternatively you could shave 10 seconds off of six levels. You might even find a shortcut that lets you take a whole minute off of just one level. The choice is yours!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master the core movement mechanics; wall jumping, wall riding, air dashing, sliding, boosting, and of course, double jumping.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/WallRidingWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Play through 25 unique levels set across various time periods across all of history, including five boss fights.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/Boss.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Defeat robotic minions, and when you do you\u2019ll earn a boost powerup that you can use later.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/Enemies.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Explore the levels to find better routes, hidden shortcuts, and collectables.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/CDCollectionWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /><br></li><li>Ever wanted to speedrun a game but felt too intimidated to start? L8R SK8R is a game that is built around making you approach it like a speedrunner, so it might just scratch that itch!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/extras/JumpingAroundWide.gif?t=1744350282\" /></li></ul>","developers":["Busalonium"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046610/header.jpg?t=1744350282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257051408,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051408/movie480.mp4?t=1742137505","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051408/movie_max.mp4?t=1742137505"},"name":"First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257051408/f0b9ba2cd1fa3467f4fd4249da1677df6f7a75c5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742137505","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051408/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742137505","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051408/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742137505"}}],"name":"L8R SK8R","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz dual-core Intel Core i5 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD R9 270<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Busalonium"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":